/* Number of directory levels needed to store size bytes in files of
 * TREEPAGESIZE bytes with TREEDIRSIZE entries per directory.
 * level 0: TREEDIRSIZE files directly below the root => covers TREEDIRSIZE*TREEPAGESIZE
 * level n: covers TREEDIRSIZE^(n+1)*TREEPAGESIZE
